  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sindh Coastal Resilience Integrated Programme (SCRIP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project, to be implemented in priority districts of Thatta and Suajjawal will improve coastal communities&#x2019; resilience to climate change and their ability to adapt and mitigate climate risks and has the following objectives:

&#x2022;	Strengthened local capacity for disaster preparedness, coastal resilience planning, and knowledge and coping capacities

&#x2022;	Improved management of Mangroves by target communities through resilient and sustainable solutions 

Key interventions will include a foundation mapping and needs assessment, development of coastal resilience plans, deploying disaster mitigation and adaptation solutions, community bases disaster risk management, improving marine-based livelihood opportunities, promoting regenerative farming, provision of clean energy solutions, and improvements in water, sanitation and hygiene through targeted WASH infrastructure support.</narrative>
  </description>
